<item><title>Escola de Samba Tropical plans 1,200-person Isaura Gomes tribute</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/escola-de-samba-tropical-plans-1-200-person-isaura-gomes-8b127d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/escola-de-samba-tropical-plans-1-200-person-isaura-gomes-8b127d/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The São Vicente group will divide its Carnaval 2027 parade into three sections and estimates preparation costs at 11,900 contos.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:21:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Neves wins second Cape Verde presidential term by more than 40,000 votes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-second-cape-verde-presidential-term-by-more-than-48aa3c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/neves-wins-second-cape-verde-presidential-term-by-more-than-48aa3c/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The incumbent widened his 2021 lead over his nearest rival, while abstention remained above 60% in Sunday&apos;s vote.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:12:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde&apos;s parliament receives budget proposal worth 101.7 billion escudos</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-parliament-receives-budget-proposal-worth-101-71f514/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-parliament-receives-budget-proposal-worth-101-71f514/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The draft projects 5.7% growth and 1.8% inflation, while a technical analysis questions the quality and resilience of those forecasts.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:12:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-parliament-receives-budget-proposal-worth-101-71f514/share.jpg" length="42226" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-parliament-receives-budget-proposal-worth-101-71f514/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Miss and Mister Inter Zonas show to feature 11 São Vicente areas</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/miss-and-mister-inter-zonas-show-to-feature-11-sao-vicente-54f8ed/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/miss-and-mister-inter-zonas-show-to-feature-11-sao-vicente-54f8ed/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The third contest, set for 19 December at Mindelo Technical School&apos;s auditorium, will build its four presentations around the colours of Cape Verde&apos;s flag.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:41:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde confirms Neves re-election with 63.96% of valid votes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-confirms-neves-re-election-with-63-96-of-valid-934ecb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-confirms-neves-re-election-with-63-96-of-valid-934ecb/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The election commission reported 68.33% abstention, the highest in a presidential election, and said its voter register relies on 2007 data.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:07:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
